Editorial markup closes outside a cross-reference or a bracket run

```
{+a </#x+}> b+}
.
<p><ins>a &lt;/#x+}&gt; b</ins></p>
```

```
{+a [x+}](u) b+}
.
<p><ins>a <a href="u">x+}</a> b</ins></p>
```

```
{-a [x](u-}) b-}
.
<p><del>a <a href="u-}">x</a> b</del></p>
```

```
{~a [x~>y](u) b~}
.
<p><s>a <a href="u">x~&gt;y</a> b</s></p>
```

```
{~a </#x~>y> b~}
.
<p><s>a &lt;/#x~&gt;y&gt; b</s></p>
```
